From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 22 Jun 2026 02:55:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add "We Put You 1st" and warranty/insurance block patterns

Registers two Gutenberg block patterns (services intro section and
the workmanship warranty / insurance claims rows) with matching CSS,
following the theme's existing custom-section convention.
---
 functions.php          |   3 +
 inc/block-patterns.php | 213 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 style.css              | 117 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 333 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 inc/block-patterns.php

diff --git a/functions.php b/functions.php
index 448e377..ec9be57 100644
--- a/functions.php
+++ b/functions.php
@@ -252,6 +252,9 @@ add_filter( 'excerpt_more', 'firstchoice_excerpt_link_text', 999 );
 /** Secondary navigation traversal feature. */
 require get_template_directory() . '/inc/subnav-walker-class.php';
 
+/** Custom block patterns for this theme. */
+require get_stylesheet_directory() . '/inc/block-patterns.php';
